WEBVTT

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.040
Per the Special Anti-Terrorism Measures Act,

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.610
we now place all terminals in the designated
 area under Public Security's electronic control.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:30.600
<i>Anticipating that cyberterrorism 
against Harimadara Heavy Industries</i>

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.980
<i>will lead to a shutdown of operations, Home Affairs has...</i>

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.060
<i>HQ to Squad 357.</i>

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Transfer command to Section 9.</i>

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.430
<i>This is Priority One.</i>

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.640
Murderers!

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.980
Murderers!

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:47.220
Give back our water!

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.990
<i>Despite increasingly fierce protests,</i>

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.570
Give back our water!

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:55.170
<i>a contract has just been signed between a Kuzan
 water company and the Japanese giant Harimadara.</i>

