00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.150
It's starting.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.560
All channels within the revised limits are clear.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.620
All Home Affairs and MLIT lines now under our control.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:33.820
Ready for domination.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.150
Begin.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.510
All lifelines, surveillance devices,

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.580
and other electronics surrounding the
 building and nearby roads are dominated.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.970
Profiling cyberbrains and terminals of 4,022 people in the area.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:07.040
1,102 require follow-up.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:10.230
Aramaki! What are you doing to <i>my</i> crime scene?!

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:15.520
Section 6 speaking. Care to explain why you've infiltrated our comm lines?!

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:20.200
We need to prevent casualties, 
not play departmental musical chairs!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.170
Or will you take the fall when we can't even pin down their means of attack?!

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.010
Chief Aramaki, explain yourself.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.670
Vice-Minister Kitahara.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.100
I thought you were attending the celebratory banquet.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.630
So what you've warned me of is unfolding, then.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:42.700
We received an anonymous tip that a 
Qhardi group mobilized three hours ago.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.930
Anonymous?

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.890
Is it trustworthy?

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:51.430
<i>Yes. The Yotsubashi Building area is definitely the target.</i>

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:56.520
The old dog's sure fired up, 
considering we're flying blind here.

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:03.120
Batou, this is the outfit we've been after ever since the cyber-contamination at Harimadara four months ago.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.580
"We"? You mean you.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.540
Did you make this, Major?

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.330
It ain't a toy, rookie.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.930
It's a military-grade virtual comm link.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:17.310
It's almost impossible for hackers to listen in.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.420
Section 9 forced the domination through.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.470
We'll have orders soon.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.640
Nab one of the terrorists.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.430
I want bait to draw out our prey.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.770
Is it that super-wizard-class hacker,

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.400
Fire-Starter?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.270
<i>Isn't that just what you want?</i>

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.450
<i>We don't even know if there's 
really someone pulling the strings.</i>

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.390
<i>What I want is to formally establish my spec ops team.</i>

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.140
<i>If you're scared of unknown enemies, drop out.</i>

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.380
<i>Piss off.</i>

