00:56:45.100 --> 00:56:47.630
Spirits,

00:56:47.630 --> 00:56:49.340
We're calling,

00:56:49.340 --> 00:56:51.710
We're calling your name.

00:56:54.090 --> 00:56:55.910
Your name.

00:56:55.910 --> 00:57:00.870
We split in two.

00:57:00.870 --> 00:57:02.550
We're sleeping

00:57:02.550 --> 00:57:05.110
While slipping away.

00:57:07.340 --> 00:57:09.470
No way home.

00:57:17.280 --> 00:57:18.510
Ghost,

00:57:20.640 --> 00:57:22.690
Left to roam.

